---
import Person from '../assets/icons/solid/person.svg';
---

<div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
  <div class="card-body space-y-6">
    <h2 class="card-title text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
      <Person class="h-7 w-7 shrink-0 fill-primary" />
      About Me
    </h2>
    <div class="space-y-5 text-base-content/90">
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Hey there! I'm a software engineer who loves turning complex problems
        into elegant solutions—one line of code at a time.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        With 9+ years in the trenches of full-stack development, I've built
        everything from intricate web dashboards to scalable cloud-native
        applications. Currently, I'm at Cohesity as Member of Technical Staff
        III, where I get to work on challenging problems at the intersection of
        frontend architecture and backend systems. For the past two years, I've
        also been wearing the Scrum Master hat, leading a team of 7 talented
        developers through the full development lifecycle—from sprint planning
        to retrospectives.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        My toolkit is diverse: Angular, React, and Vue.js on the frontend;
        Node.js, NestJS, Java Spring Boot, and Go on the backend; AWS and GCP
        for cloud infrastructure; and Docker and Kubernetes for keeping
        everything running smoothly. But beyond the tech stack, what really
        drives me is creating software that people actually enjoy using.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        I'm a firm believer that great software comes from great collaboration.
        Whether I'm pair programming with a colleague, mentoring junior
        developers (helping them navigate their first complex feature or
        debugging session), or facilitating team discussions, I value the human
        side of software development as much as the technical side. There's
        something incredibly fulfilling about seeing someone you've mentored
        ship their first major feature with confidence.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        When I'm not coding, you'll probably find me exploring new technologies,
        experimenting with side projects, or thinking about better ways to solve
        the problems I tackled today. I see every project as an opportunity to
        learn something new and push my skills a little further.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        If you're looking for someone who combines technical depth with a
        passion for building things that matter, let's connect!
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
